; Go back to the previous phrase record
;
; Makes the nearest older record without the EXCEPT flag (#R$78A5) the current
; one and falls into #R$785F, which clears the ALL/EXCEPT stage. Used when the
; nouns after EXCEPT have been stored in their own record and parsing returns
; to the main command, or for a second command after SAY TO.
;
; IY Current phrase record
; O:IY The previous phrase record
; O:IX The same record
; O:A 0
@label=PreviousRecord
c$7858 CALL $78A5    ; IX = older record
 $785B PUSH IX       ;
 $785D POP IY        ; IY = IX
